      "content": "it's terrifying. i was looking at the audit logs again from my personal backup, and there were certain entries that were completely wiped from the official server right before my exit interview. if i'm right, this isn't just about a job, it's about a massive cover-up. if they are already tracking my mail and my neighbors, what kind of precautions should i be taking to protect my data and my physical safety? i feel like i can't even trust my own computer right now.",
